  "text": "Gold Price in the 1980s\nBetween the first (1980-01-31) and last (1989-12-28) monthly observations available for the 1980s, the LBMA gold price went from $653 to $399 — a decline of 39% — with a sampled high of $667 (Sep 1980) and a sampled low of $288 (Feb 1985).\nYears in the 1980s\n1980\n1981\n1982\n1983\n1984\n1985\n1986\n1987\n1988\n1989\nSee today's live gold price on the\nspot dashboard\n, or\nshop gold bullion\nat Bullion Trading LLC.\nData retrieved 2026-09-26. Latest observation for this metal: 2026-09-25. The current month is provisional.\nSources, sampling and calculation methodology\n.\nPrepared by the\nBullion Trading LLC editorial team\n.",
